{"verses":[{"number":1,"text":"Vindicate|strong=\"H8199\"me|strong=\"H3808\", God|strong=\"H3808\", and|strong=\"H1471\"plead|strong=\"H7378\"my|strong=\"H7378\"cause|strong=\"H7379\"against|strong=\"H7378\"an ungodly|strong=\"H3808\"nation|strong=\"H1471\".  \nOh, deliver|strong=\"H6403\"me|strong=\"H3808\"from|strong=\"H1471\"deceitful|strong=\"H4820\"and|strong=\"H1471\"wicked|strong=\"H5766\"men.   \n"},{"number":2,"text":"For|strong=\"H3588\"you|strong=\"H3588\"are|strong=\"H4100\"the|strong=\"H3588\"God of|strong=\"H4581\"my|strong=\"H3588\"strength|strong=\"H4581\". Why|strong=\"H4100\"have|strong=\"H3588\"you|strong=\"H3588\"rejected|strong=\"H2186\"me|strong=\"H3588\"?  \nWhy|strong=\"H4100\"do|strong=\"H4100\"I|strong=\"H3588\"go|strong=\"H1980\"mourning|strong=\"H6937\"because|strong=\"H3588\"of|strong=\"H4581\"the|strong=\"H3588\"oppression|strong=\"H3906\"of|strong=\"H4581\"the|strong=\"H3588\"enemy?   \n"},{"number":3,"text":"Oh, send|strong=\"H7971\"out|strong=\"H7971\"your|strong=\"H7971\"light and|strong=\"H7971\"your|strong=\"H7971\"truth.  \nLet|strong=\"H7971\"them|strong=\"H1992\"lead|strong=\"H5148\"me|strong=\"H7971\".  \nLet|strong=\"H7971\"them|strong=\"H1992\"bring me|strong=\"H7971\"to|strong=\"H7971\"your|strong=\"H7971\"holy|strong=\"H6944\"hill|strong=\"H2022\",  \nto|strong=\"H7971\"your|strong=\"H7971\"tents|strong=\"H4908\".   \n"},{"number":4,"text":"Then I will|strong=\"H4196\"go to|strong=\"H4196\"the|strong=\"H3034\"altar|strong=\"H4196\"of|strong=\"H4196\"God,  \nto|strong=\"H4196\"God, my|strong=\"H3034\"exceeding|strong=\"H8057\"joy|strong=\"H8057\".  \nI will|strong=\"H4196\"praise|strong=\"H3034\"you|strong=\"H3034\"on|strong=\"H4196\"the|strong=\"H3034\"harp|strong=\"H3658\", God, my|strong=\"H3034\"God.   \n"},{"number":5,"text":"Why|strong=\"H4100\"are|strong=\"H4100\"you|strong=\"H3588\"in|strong=\"H5921\"despair|strong=\"H7817\", my|strong=\"H5921\"soul|strong=\"H5315\"?  \nWhy|strong=\"H4100\"are|strong=\"H4100\"you|strong=\"H3588\"disturbed|strong=\"H1993\"within|strong=\"H5921\"me|strong=\"H6440\"?  \nHope|strong=\"H3176\"in|strong=\"H5921\"God!  \nFor|strong=\"H3588\"I|strong=\"H3588\"shall|strong=\"H5315\"still|strong=\"H5750\"praise|strong=\"H3034\"him|strong=\"H6440\":  \nmy|strong=\"H5921\"Savior, my|strong=\"H5921\"helper, and|strong=\"H6440\"my|strong=\"H5921\"God.   \n"}]}
